## Getting started

<!-- <scaffold:readme-commands> -->
<!-- </scaffold:readme-commands> -->

Scenarios live in `tests/scenarios/<feature>/`, one happy path, two validation failures and one fault
injection per feature. Profiles are in `config/run-profiles.json`.
